    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🖱️ HireFlow — Slack Actions (Human-in-the-Loop)\nThe hiring manager clicks Approve / Decline on the Slack card → the right Gmail DRAFT is prepared, the ATS stage advances, and the card locks with an audit stamp of who decided.\n**Every candidate-facing email is a draft behind a human click — never auto-sent.**\n**n8n · Slack · Airtable · Gmail**",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -430
      ],
      "id": "38687fb0-e01d-48e6-b3ec-cfbe9646d33f",
      "name": "Sticky 549de131"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1 · Button click in\nSlack posts the button click here (Interactivity webhook) — respond <3s. Code parses the form-encoded payload into the action + a self-describing candidate blob (recordId, role, name, email), so no lookup is needed.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -10,
        -270
      ],
      "id": "025a8b3c-5c9b-4cc3-a411-3d75f8fc16d9",
      "name": "Sticky ac9163a1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2 · Route\nSwitch branches on action_id: approve (top) vs decline (bottom). There is deliberately NO auto-reject path — a human already clicked.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 200,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        406,
        -270
      ],
      "id": "1fd5145f-8f36-488f-8e8f-18c3ca7611e4",
      "name": "Sticky ad6541f7"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3 · Approve → invite DRAFT\nAirtable fetches the role's booking link → Gmail DRAFT interview invite carrying it → ATS Stage → Interview → the Slack card updates in place to '✅ Approved by …' (removes the buttons, blocks double-clicks).",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        614,
        -270
      ],
      "id": "78988b13-3e8d-4168-b772-ee7737f77aa4",
      "name": "Sticky 817a9c7d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4 · Decline → rejection DRAFT\nGmail DRAFT of a kind, generic rejection (no link) → ATS Stage → Not proceeding → the Slack card updates to '✕ Declined by …'.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        614,
        240
      ],
      "id": "dfba8a77-54bf-41c4-a8ba-cf2134e4de3a",
      "name": "Sticky f5648887"
    }
